) an. Prabhākara (a. of Rasapradīpa, Weber 823); great grandfather of Kamalākara Bhaṭṭa (a. of Nirṇayasindhu), Dinakara alias Divākara (a. of Dinakaroddyota).
For his family pedigree, see Kane, HDS. I. ii. p. 906.
--Rāmakutūhala. kāvya. q. by his son Nārāyaṇa in C. on Vṛttaratnākara, Oxf. I98b.
